menu "MB1013 test app"

    config MB1013_TEST_QEMU
        bool "Run hardware-independent tests automatically (for QEMU)"
        default n
        help
            QEMU does not emulate the RMT peripheral, so only the decoding tests can run there.
            When enabled, the app runs the [decode] tests at boot, prints a summary line and
            stops, instead of showing the interactive test menu.

endmenu
